-main CommandLineTools
-neko tools.n
-D lime-curl
-D lime-cffi
-D lime
-cp platforms
-cp ../src
-lib format
-lib hxp
# NF: -lib crossbyte removed (2026-11-15). Its extraParams macros make the macro
# interpreter compile lime.ui.Window & co, where NF's compat additions
# (DropFileEvent etc.) are not macro-safe, and the genericBuild cascade through
# EventMacro breaks on `new Event<Dynamic->Void>()`. The tool keeps looking
# crossbyte up at runtime (RunScript.hx Haxelib.getPath) so html5 eval still
# works whenever crossbyte is installed; FE's branch keeps the -lib.
#-lib crossbyte
-D optional-cffi
